# The root container of ArcForges executions (ArcForges-Design 13 section 3.4; 03 section 5.1). Its limits (CPUQuota, MemoryHigh,
# MemoryMax, MemorySwapMax, TasksMax) are runtime properties the node sets through the user manager (SetUnitProperties, runtime), so the
# file carries none. Every execution is a transient unit arcforges-a-<attempt>.service in this slice.
[Unit]
Description=ArcForges managed executions

[Slice]
